comments[10]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-18T21:45:34.695Z","harness:codex","Scope decomposition of canonical pm-srns, not a duplicate parent: strict all-status read inspected all 2996 items including 2721 closed. No existing leaf owns GH-1500 or GH-1501. Existing completed pm-kvxqp1, pm-5y05kq, pm-cfed and pm-gh1408 establish compatibility boundaries. The two non-overlapping report slices will share one reviewed delivery."
  "2026-10-18T21:46:54.142Z","harness:codex","Pre-fix proof: the new public renderer round-trip regression fails because explicit nulls, empty nested values and an empty object row are removed. Existing 35 tests pass. Same test/harness will verify the fix."
  "2026-10-18T21:52:33.216Z","harness:codex","Focused proof passed 114 tests, including transport and completeness integration. TypeScript projects passed. Required live Sentry/telemetry gate passes with 0 recent unresolved issues, 2.55 percent telemetry finish error rate, and 0 missing error-code rows. Local flush drained its queue and a production query found current-minute events. Public release 2026.10.18 passes npm, npx, bunx, all bins, MCP discovery, Skills and Apps checks. Coverage is still running; any observed failure will be investigated before closeout."
  "2026-10-18T21:57:54.438Z","harness:codex","Observability proof: the explicit opt-in pm list probe produced a current Sentry pm.command span at 2026-10-18T21:55:18Z with sanitized description pm list. The production telemetry query matched 456 recent start/finish pairs using installation, process session, command and started_at. Queue inspection was 0 ready / 0 unacknowledged. These are observed samples and delivery evidence, not a universal all-actions completeness claim."
  "2026-10-18T22:14:35.238Z","harness:codex","Full-suite recovery: the complete composed producer/budget continuation journey passes through real packed SDK consumers in the bounded rerun. JSON and SDK result contracts remain unchanged. The fresh full-source coverage attempt includes the final literal-status and structural metadata guards from the companion list-envelope fix."
  "2026-10-18T22:36:56.869Z","harness:codex","Fresh final all-source coverage passes with exact counts: statements 69605/69605, branches 53470/53470, functions 14339/14339, lines 66026/66026; zero uncovered or skipped coverage counts. Full suite passed after the documented local npm module-path correction and bounded workers. Earlier failed and focused recovery receipts remain recorded. The CLI resolves directly to this checkout's dist/cli.js."
  "2026-10-18T22:39:17.026Z","harness:codex","Static gate follow-up: the row-value change exceeded the existing compactToonValue complexity ceiling (17 vs 16, cognitive 19 vs 16). Extracted its array step into a private helper without semantic changes. The 10751-test / exact-100-percent run above certifies the pre-extraction source. Current primary regressions, static/packed gates and exact-head hosted coverage will certify the final refactor; no threshold was raised."
  "2026-10-18T22:52:39.847Z","harness:codex","Additional same-boundary probe: a JSON row with own keys id and __proto__ renders with only id through the host formatter. Direct SDK table encode, TOON encode/decode and SDK restoration preserve both keys, isolating the omission to the host compactor's ordinary-object accumulator. Include this edge case under the active row-facts owner rather than duplicating it as another issue."
  "2026-10-18T22:57:23.462Z","harness:codex","Token regression sensitivity: preserving all empty row values initially expanded health-default to 258 estimated tokens above its unchanged 164-token ceiling. The new health diagnostic regression failed before the scoped correction. It now passes with 109 primary tests, and the 32-surface token gate passes unchanged. Only empty details objects on successful health rows are projected away; material/failing/null diagnostics and ordinary JSON remain intact."
  "2026-10-18T23:46:17.784Z","harness:codex","Final local implementation evidence: all 110 primary tests, 32 unchanged token surfaces, the complete pnpm quality:static gate, linked row tests, packed npm/npx/bunx workflows and four TypeScript projects pass. The reserved-key regression failed on the prior host accumulator and passes with entry-based object reconstruction. Graph/context assurance passes after adding the actual cited lineage. Full-source coverage on the final pushed source remains a required CI merge gate; the earlier 10751-test exact-100-percent receipt is retained with its source-stage qualification."
learnings[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-18T22:02:35.703Z","harness:codex","Apply sparse row encoding before any lossy null/empty projection: a missing key and a present null must retain distinct meanings. Preserve row collection cardinality, including empty object rows and nested empty containers, even when lean JSON remains explicitly lossy."
  "2026-10-18T22:57:25.006Z","harness:codex","For host row changes, probe null, empty, sparse and reserved-key data together, and run the fast producer token ratchets before broad verification. Lossless table encoding cannot recover facts already dropped by host compaction, while compact diagnostics need explicit producer-owned omission rules."
